{"title":"Dust Mote","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Monster drop: Sirocco, Sand Devil, Dust Devil</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>How to get it</h2>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <div style=\"margin-top:10px\"><b>Recorded monster drops</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink elite\" data-monster=\"dust-devil\" title=\"Dust Devil - dropped it in 49 of 65 looted corpses (1/1.3)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/f34357445edb2cc8b0c3.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Dust Devil</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1.3<br>×1–10</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink elite\" data-monster=\"sirocco\" title=\"Sirocco - dropped it in 212 of 296 looted corpses (1/1.4)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/09b45d3b4d34c05d314b.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Sirocco</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1.4<br>×1–9</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink elite\" data-monster=\"sand-devil\" title=\"Sand Devil - dropped it in 192 of 283 looted corpses (1/1.5)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/d197bb2687af7a8b0b16.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Sand Devil</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1.5<br>×1–10</span></div></div><div class=\"s muted\" style=\"margin-top:6px\">Drop rate as 1/X (about 1 kill in X drops it, counted over the corpses of each monster whose loot was recorded), and ×N, how many come in one drop.</div></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"item\" data-map-id=\"dust-mote\">Show where to get it on the map</button>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic \"><img src=\"data/img/1c70ff443aaceb81445a.svg\" alt=\"Dust Mote\"></div><h3>Dust Mote</h3><table>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <tr><th>Dropped by</th><td>3 monsters</t